:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68);\"&gt;Hi,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68);\"&gt;Just came across a new site &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.myweddingstory.co\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(254,41,113);\"&gt;www.myweddingstory.co&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68);\"&gt; and I&#039;m wondering if anyone has used it yet. I&#039;m looking for a place to share my videos, pics, audio, etc. from my wedding. I&#039;ve already created a \"How We Met\" storyline with cute quiz questions, etc. Now I&#039;m trying to decide if it&#039;s worth the money to use it for my other ideas.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68);\"&gt;Thoughts?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68);\"&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901354,"PostDate":1438104945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span><span  style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">Hi,<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">Just came across a new site <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddingstory.co\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(254,41,113)\">www.myweddingstory.co<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68)\"> and I'm wondering if anyone has used it yet. I'm looking for a place to share my videos, pics, audio, etc. from my wedding. I've already created a \"How We Met\" storyline with cute quiz questions, etc. Now I'm trying to decide if it's worth the money to use it for my other ideas.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">Thoughts?<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><span  style=\"font-size:14.6666666666667px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(68,68,68)\">Thanks!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"noahandcatherine@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.122.253.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438098546,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284170.jpg?_r=1439197006","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Catherine66","Id":284170,"Name":"Catherine66","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79441,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5831a8a8e980e99ec84e31c5a425f655","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Try mywedding.com, you can create a free wedding website and if you download the weddingparty app, you can link this with the website also so all those that have the app and add pictures from your wedding they load onto your website.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901439,"PostDate":1438163886,"PostContent":"            <htm