     <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Lucy & Tom - Married 24.11.08<\/strong><\/i><br><strong>Wedding Review - Dreams PC:<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/thomasjsgirl-dreams-pc-wedding-nov-24-08-a-35102\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...24-08-a-35102\/<\/a><strong><br>Leftover Wedding Items FS:<\/strong><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f37\/leftover-wedding-stuff-56124\/\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...g-stuff-56124\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lucy_mazzoli@rogers.com","IpAddress":"24.114.255.7","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208673960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209148.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Thomasjsgirl","Id":209148,"Name":"Thomasjsgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":53288,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31a61b762ae243b87416d1de9aa09df9","RawContent":"When I tell the story to friends about his attempted proposal in the jewelry store, he always replies with &amp;quot;Well you ruined the surprise factor..&amp;quot;. To which I reply &amp;quot;I don&#039;t remember inviting myself to go ring shopping&amp;quot; (his first attempts by himself were on the sly).","Attachments":[],"Id":1187880,"PostDate":1276810028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                  