{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1694f0f772de2caa99db8fc58897cadb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We did! We met on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/x.azjmp.com\/4X8PY\"&gt;e-harmony&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;... and it is true!!! Everything they say! Everyone always sings us the theme song... This will be an everlasting love lol.... I recommend it to all single friends that are looking to meet someone... if you never try, you never know!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":468419,"PostDate":1222882785,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We did! We met on <strong><a href='http:\/\/x.azjmp.com\/4X8PY' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>e-harmony<\/a><\/strong>... and it is true!!! Everything they say! Everyone always sings us the theme song... This will be an everlasting love lol.... I recommend it to all single friends that are looking to meet someone... if you never try, you never know!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>~Joanna~<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;130\/st\/20090627\/e\/Our+Wedding%21\/k\/674b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...674b\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"JoLo908@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1196892763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208008.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoLo908","Id":208008,"Name":"JoLo908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"085476f3f6c0b8811d6bcf7c6b7f9fb1","RawContent":"we met on yahoo, in a chat room, started just as friends, chatted for about 3 months then met for the first time, we had talked on the phone a few times before. We were meeting as friends at first, he knew all about my bad dates and I knew all about his bad divorce and we going to be friends but then we met a few times and he liked what he saw I guess.","Attachments":[],"Id":468449,"PostDate":1222884953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we met on yahoo, in a chat room, started just as friends, chatted for about 3 months then met for the first time, we had talked on the phone a few times before. We were meeting as friends at first, he knew all about my bad dates and I knew all about his bad divorce and we going to be friends but then we met a few times and he liked what he saw I guess.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/3IrCm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dv.daisypath.com\/3IrCm4\/.png<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span>[url=<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/weight-loss\/wicGfvN\/%5D\">http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/weight-loss\/wicGfvN\/]<\/a><br \/>\n<span>[img]<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"llmg970@netzero.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1219695545,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211372.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lmg970","Id":211372,"Name":"lmg970","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9a09adec734bdfb051d1ca7c599d7a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we didn&#039;t, but i know at least 4 people (outside BDW) that met their future husbands on &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/x.azjmp.com\/4X8PY\"&gt;eharmony&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; or match. i think it&#039;s great. i have lots of friends on there as well&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":468451,"PostDate":1222885088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we didn't, but i know at least 4 people (outside BDW) that met their future husbands on <strong><a href='http:\/\/x.azjmp.com\/4X8PY' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>eharmony<\/a><\/strong> or match. i think it's great. i have lots of friends on there as well<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/tvts-las-caletas-wedding-review-pics-31890\/\">My Las Caletas Wedding Review<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/more-pro-pics-our-las-caletas-wedding-32657\/\">Pro Wedding Pics<\/a><span> <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/tvts-eyespy-photography-review-pics-31889\/\">EyeSpy Photography Review<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/teaser-ttd-pics-31998\/\">TTD Pics<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tjvanthiel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.28.94.136","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174672560,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207287.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tvt","Id":207287,"Name":"tvt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75edb28b7eb2882127cdf9b402e9e4b2","RawContent":"Karen and I met on Yahoo personals and could not be happier! At first telling people how we met seemed a little strange, but it was never an issue between the two of us. \n \n I think it is becoming a lot more common and accepted these days. Sure, there are creeps on the internet, but they are out there in the real world too.","Attachments":[],"Id":468473,"PostDate":1222885991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Karen and I met on Yahoo personals and could not be happier! At first telling people how we met seemed a little strange, but it was never an issue between the two of us. <br \/> <br \/> I think it is becoming a lot more common and accepted these days. Sure, there are creeps on the internet, but they are out there in the real world too.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Jason...............<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/s180.photobucket.com\/albums\/x91\/jnklambert\/honeymoon%20photos\/?start=all\">Our Honeymoon Photos<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/s180.photobucket.com\/albums\/x91\/jnklambert\/\">Our Wedding Photos<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lambert13@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1167864840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207010.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lambert13","Id":207010,"Name":"lambert13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba5e98ef39aeb3f252b184bcb0c0f04c","RawContent":"I met my FI online as well!!...I didn&#039;t think I would ever put a profile up on a dating site, but I am so happy I did! We&#039;ve been together for 2 1\/2 years and it&#039;s been the best time of my life!","Attachments":[],"Id":468487,"PostDate":1222886772,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I met my FI online as well!!...I didn't think I would ever put a profile up on a dating site, but I am so happy I did! We've been together for 2 1\/2 years and it's been the best time of my life!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>D & K<\/strong><br><strong>October 16th, 2008-Riu<\/strong><span> <\/span><strong>Palace Cabo San Lucas<\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081016\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/7276\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...7276\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"KAYLEE0628@YAHOO.CA","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1218145800,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211042.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KAMAY11","Id":211042,"Name":"KAMAY11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe9b34e49f95bb7969254df12dbc801a","RawContent":"I met mine on Date.ca (its a Canadian thing). A bunch of girls I work with were bugging me to get back on the dating scene and most of them had had really good luck with online dating - 2 of them were engaged at the time. We hit it off (both of us have the same demented sense of humour) and turns out we had mutual friends\/aquaintences, talk about 6 degrees of separation. The rest is history!","Attachments":[],"Id":468503,"PostDate":1222887088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I met mine on Date.ca (its a Canadian thing). A bunch of girls I work with were bugging me to get back on the dating scene and most of them had had really good luck with online dating - 2 of them were engaged at the time. We hit it off (both of us have the same demented sense of humour) and turns out we had mutual friends\/aquaintences, talk about 6 degrees of separation. The rest is history!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"k8watmough@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214333334,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210135.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sloan","Id":210135,"Name":"Sloan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9496d5391e12624d3a669bc171d6e74","RawContent":"We didn&#039;t actually meet online, we were introduced through mutual friends, however 3 days later my FI then left for 6 weeks for a work trip...so since I was interested in him (and it was clearly mutual) we kept in touch by chatting online getting to know each other and then went on a first date when he came back. I even remember chatting on msn when he was on the flight home from Saudi Arabia through Germany which apparently had internet access!\n \n So it&#039;s not as exciting as meeting online but I guess the theory is the same that you can really get to know someone via an online chat situation. We were able to address some important questions about likes and dislikes and whatnot before we had an official first date which made things a lot more comfortable!","Attachments":[],"Id":468528,"PostDate":1222888798,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We didn't actually meet online, we were introduced through mutual friends, however 3 days later my FI then left for 6 weeks for a work trip...so since I was interested in him (and it was clearly mutual) we kept in touch by chatting online getting to know each other and then went on a first date when he came back. I even remember chatting on msn when he was on the flight home from Saudi Arabia through Germany which apparently had internet access!<br \/> <br \/> So it's not as exciting as meeting online but I guess the theory is the same that you can really get to know someone via an online chat situation. We were able to address some important questions about likes and dislikes and whatnot before we had an official first date which made things a lot more comfortable!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"llounds@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.218.210","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1215880680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210493.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Lo*","Id":210493,"Name":"*Lo*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f0ace8bd66a6350a90e2ceafc49e613","RawContent":"i was one of the people who eharmony couldn&#039;t help LOL. i spent all that time signing up and filling out their personality profile quiz, answering as truthfully as possible, and got a &amp;quot;we&#039;re sorry&amp;quot; from them (you may have heard of this from the chemistry.com commercials). i forget the exact wording but something about it working by fitting you into a certain category and that i didn&#039;t fit into any of them ... i wasn&#039;t sure whether to be mad or proud?\n \n apparently their matching system can&#039;t work for 1\/5 of the people who try to sign up? i wondered why they didn&#039;t just put all those people together LOL, but i&#039;m glad they didn&#039;t because i probably never would have ended up meeting tom. all things happen for a reason!","Attachments":[],"Id":468720,"PostDate":1222897299,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i was one of the people who eharmony couldn't help LOL. i spent all that time signing up and filling out their personality profile quiz, answering as truthfully as possible, and got a \"we're sorry\" from them (you may have heard of this from the chemistry.com commercials). i forget the exact wording but something about it working by fitting you into a certain category and that i didn't fit into any of them ... i wasn't sure whether to be mad or proud?<br \/> <br \/> apparently their matching system can't work for 1\/5 of the people who try to sign up? i wondered why they didn't just put all those people together LOL, but i'm glad they didn't because i probably never would have ended up meeting tom. all things happen for a reason!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/48680\/mummergirl-s-totally-after-the-fact-planning-thread#post_963823\">My After-the-Fact Planning Thread<\/a><\/span>","Email":"mummergirl@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.83.34.78","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1207106760,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208981.jpg?_r=1389220347","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cougs","Id":208981,"Name":"cougs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22c4ce38e7f932f39897cde0a2b5a668","RawContent":"My DH and I met from Cupid.com (another Canadian thing). We both had the &amp;quot;free&amp;quot; profiles - which you could browse profiles but not really contact people without paying for a subscription...but we were both sneaky and put our email addresses in amongst our descriptions of ourselves. I contacted him by email, he replied and added me to his MSN Messenger and we chatted for 6 hours straight that same night! We met in person 1 week later (after countless hours chatting online) and haven&#039;t been apart a day since!!!! We are a perfect match! \n \n Lindsay","Attachments":[],"Id":468737,"PostDate":1222898212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My DH and I met from Cupid.com (another Canadian thing). We both had the \"free\" profiles - which you could browse profiles but not really contact people without paying for a subscription...but we were both sneaky and put our email addresses in amongst our descriptions of ourselves. I contacted him by email, he replied and added me to his MSN Messenger and we chatted for 6 hours straight that same night! We met in person 1 week later (after countless hours chatting online) and haven't been apart a day since!!!! We are a perfect match! <br \/> <br \/> Lindsay\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ta.lindsay@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1168748100,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207065.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Lindsay","Id":207065,"Name":"TA Lindsay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24565,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67b9e2692664ca4bbeedc8992eba40c8","RawContent":"My FI and I met online on (of all places) Hot or Not! Haha...I still find it funny. Anyway, he lived 3000 miles from me but we became great friends and e-pals...I used to race home from work just to see what humorous email he send that day. The time came when he told me that he was coming home for Christmas to see his parents and asked if we could meet...I was a little skeptical at first but agreed to meet for coffee. We were inseparable for the next 2 weeks. We were in a long distance relationship for about a year and then he told me that he couldn&#039;t live without me everyday so he moved back home. 4 years later and a proposal and here we are!","Attachments":[],"Id":469224,"PostDate":1222919571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My FI and I met online on (of all places) Hot or Not! Haha...I still find it funny. Anyway, he lived 3000 miles from me but we became great friends and e-pals...I used to race home from work just to see what humorous email he send that day. The time came when he told me that he was coming home for Christmas to see his parents and asked if we could meet...I was a little skeptical at first but agreed to meet for coffee. We were inseparable for the next 2 weeks. We were in a long distance relationship for about a year and then he told me that he couldn't live without me everyday so he moved back home. 4 years later and a proposal and here we are!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/ss356\/jennierin\/DSC04983.jpg\">http:\/\/i591.photobucket.com\/albums\/s...n\/DSC04983.jpg<\/a><br><span>First Kiss as a Mr & Mrs!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenreid1@rogers.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1222713727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212021.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":82,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennierin","Id":212021,"Name":"jennierin","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":241,"TotalPages":25,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":240},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
