the time in Dallas. Well, we got back together in June of 2006 and in May of 2007 told my Dad he wanted to marry and now here we are.","Attachments":[],"Id":223748,"PostDate":1205211996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We met in 2001 dated for a bit, went our separate ways in 2002 but kept running into each other. It was weird, he was in a completely different city and somehow we managed to see each other all the time in Dallas. Well, we got back together in June of 2006 and in May of 2007 told my Dad he wanted to marry and now here we are.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/mark-and-sandra.com\/\">http:\/\/mark-and-sandra.com\/<\/a><br><span>My wedding review: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t19192\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t19192<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sodria@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1203797278,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208625.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandra E.","Id":208625,"Name":"Sandra E.","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":12665,"Ed