d":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89a4b2bb457ce5a4a5a995d32d467f05","RawContent":"I just ventured on my DIY path so I&#039;m no where near this.  However the lovely Sarah from Sprouille Designs did.  She is dynamic to work with!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Starfish0512[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Great colors!!!  Did you make these?!  I&#039;m taking the boarding pass route for our invites!\n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1494793,"PostDate":1311875585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> I just ventured on my DIY path so I'm no where near this.\u00a0 However the lovely Sarah from Sprouille Designs did.\u00a0 She is dynamic to work with!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Starfish0512<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Great colors!!!\u00a0 Did you make these?!\u00a0 I'm taking the boarding pass route for our invites!<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>My Planning Thread: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78847\/coconoirs-planning-thread-picture-heavy\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78847\/coconoirs-planning-thread-picture-heavy<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Our Wedding Feature: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/blog\/real-wedding-chanel-derick%E2%80%A8\">http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/blog\/real-wedding-chanel-derick%E2%80%A8<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chanel.conley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.78.193.252","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1275117649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228663.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"coconoir1908","Id":228663,"Name":"coconoir1908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26e99e1479a31b010b550e632473ef8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"magnet.pdf\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/498839\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1494843,"PostDate":1311877841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"magnet.pdf\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/498839\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chogan7@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1308158942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Bride2012","Id":241180,"Name":"Bride2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"643e378a720cbad7cf9939f168cfe0f3","RawContent":"Of course she did! That&#039;s why I love them so much!!!!  I adore her work and have been admiring one of her designs for my invites but with only needing 10 invites, I have accepted that I can make my own for a lot less than $300.  She did a lovely job with yours!!! \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]coconoir1908[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I just ventured on my DIY path so I&#039;m no where near this.  However the lovely Sarah from Sprouille Designs did.  She is dynamic to work with!\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1494875,"PostDate":1311879974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Of course she did! That's why I love them so much!!!!\u00a0 I adore her work and have been admiring one of her designs for my invites but with only needing 10 invites, I have accepted that I can make my own for a lot less than $300.\u00a0 She did a lovely job with yours!!!\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>coconoir1908<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> I just ventured on my DIY path so I'm no where near this.\u00a0 However the lovely Sarah from Sprouille Designs did.\u00a0 She is dynamic to work with!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shaunandstefanie@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295551451,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235778.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":215,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Starfish0512","Id":235778,"Name":"Starfish0512","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a81d4b6e8514cb84600d2313fcae47bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Did them myself with my fiance. Got cardstock and printed\/cutted them accordingly. Luggage tags were originally table number placecards (or so it says on the box) We purchased at Michaels with a coupon and all in all with postage, and every little cost, including the stickers cost $63 for 25 mailed out. I&#039;ve included the front, back, envelope, and back of envelope pictures. The sealable stickers are from shutterfly.com.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"CIMG5597.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/499234\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"CIMG5602.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/499240\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"CIMG5604.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/499242\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"CIMG5613.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/499244\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1495112,"PostDate":1311898633,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did them myself with my fiance. Got cardstock and printed\/cutted them accordingly. Luggage tags were originally table number placecards (or so it says on the box) We purchased at Michaels with a coupon and all in all with postage, and every little cost, including the stickers cost $63 for 25 mailed out. I've included the front, back, envelope, and back of envelope pictures. The sealable stickers are from shutterfly.com.<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CIMG5597.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/499234\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"CIMG5602.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bes