height\"><p><span>My Planning Thread: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78847\/coconoirs-planning-thread-picture-heavy\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78847\/coconoirs-planning-thread-picture-heavy<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Our Wedding Feature: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/blog\/real-wedding-chanel-derick%E2%80%A8\">http:\/\/www.preownedweddingdresses.com\/blog\/real-wedding-chanel-derick%E2%80%A8<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chanel.conley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.78.193.252","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1275117649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228663.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"coconoir1908","Id":228663,"Name":"coconoir1908","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fea45e49bd4d074ee82e0c433adfb771","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516576\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I had to take a picture of a picture since I cannot seem to upload the digital image...they are magnets.. They came out soo great and for a great price. We wanted to keep them light and fun to convey not only a wedding but a fun vacation&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; !&lt;img alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516592\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;I also made these fun return address labels...we wanted to include our dog in the fun stuff since he cant come to Mexico and everyone who knows us loves him (probably more than they love us) !! Now I am trying to figure out the invites..we are going to go more classic and elegant on those since we were kinda cheesey on these&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1505535,"PostDate":1313520996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516576\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> I had to take a picture of a picture since I cannot seem to upload the digital image...they are magnets.. They came out soo great and for a great price. We wanted to keep them light and fun to convey not only a wedding but a fun vacation<\/p> <p> !<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516592\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>\u00a0I also made these fun return address labels...we wanted to include our dog in the fun stuff since he cant come to Mexico and everyone who knows us loves him (probably more than they love us) !! Now I am trying to figure out the invites..we are going to go more classic and elegant on those since we were kinda cheesey on these<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauren.glinski@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297124188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236498.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lau080285","Id":236498,"Name":"lau080285","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fdf9edc29f1a418d31aa8f0a6435f3f","RawContent":"cute! what website did you make the magnets?\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lau080285[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516576\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n I had to take a picture of a picture since I cannot seem to upload the digital image...they are magnets.. They came out soo great and for a great price. We wanted to keep them light and fun to convey not only a wedding but a fun vacation \n ![img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516592\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] I also made these fun return address labels...we wanted to include our dog in the fun stuff since he cant come to Mexico and everyone who knows us loves him (probably more than they love us) !! Now I am trying to figure out the invites..we are going to go more classic and elegant on those since we were kinda cheesey on these[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1506085,"PostDate":1313590264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> cute! what website did you make the magnets?<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lau080285<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516576\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> I had to take a picture of a picture since I cannot seem to upload the digital image...they are magnets.. They came out soo great and for a great price. We wanted to keep them light and fun to convey not only a wedding but a fun vacation<\/p> <p> !<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/516592\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span>\u00a0I also made these fun return address labels...we wanted to include our dog in the fun stuff since he cant come to Mexico and everyone who knows us loves him (probably more than they love us) !! Now I am trying to figure out the invites..we are going to go more classic and elegant on those since we were kinda cheesey on these<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61925,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17d9d6f22cfba61fe3045dd149d60c25","RawCon